# Analyzers

- Interface-first: follow `analyzer_interface/` before implementing
- Primary: normalize core results; Secondary: user-facing transforms; Web: Dash/Shiny via `factory.py`
- Entry: `analyzers/*/main.py` → `main()`; register in `analyzers/__init__.py` `suite`
- Keep domain boundaries: analyzers stay in content domain; no storage/UI coupling shortcuts
- Test full workflows with real-ish `test_data/`
- Deep context: `@.ai-context/symbol-reference.md`, Serena symbols if MCP available
